<title>POLAND: Dom-Plast may make Rubbermaid products.</title>
<headline>Dom-Plast may make Rubbermaid products.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish plastic products maker Dom-Plast SA, 89.6-percent owned by Rubbermaid, has received a licence to produce and sell Rubbermaid products, Dom-Plast said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>Dom-Plast said it would pay Rubbermaid three percent of annual net sales for the licence.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
